    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# PPDO Portal releases\nv0.1 to v1.9.0. Click a hub card to open that version's documents. Source: the release history in the repo-root `CLAUDE.md`.\n\n[Docs home](HOME.md)"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-v0.1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## v0.1 Foundation\n**2026-05-26**\n\nSolution scaffold, CI/CD, auth foundation.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "t-v1.0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## v1.0 Core portal and inventory\n\n\nAuth, users, resource links, dashboard, inventory monitoring. No docs folder.",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "t-v1.1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## v1.1 Budget Planning foundation\n\n\nLDIP, AIP, WFP requirements and config pages; inventory refinements, distribution.",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "h-v1.1",
